%% Lifecycle of a family invite. Claude rewrites this via /update-diagrams.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Open: Owner creates the invite
  Open --> Accepted: someone joins with the link
  Open --> Revoked: Owner revokes it
  Open --> Expired: 48 hours pass
  Accepted --> [*]
  Revoked --> [*]
  Expired --> [*]

  note right of Open
    Only the hash of the token is stored.
    A link works once.
  end note
